- Petra: My sister has returned... I never doubted you would come through for us...

    * [Glad she's safe... those thieves put up quite a fight...]
    Petra: That only proves your true strength in the face of danger... and shows just how reckless my sister has been.
    I’ll make sure she understands the risks she’s been taking.

    * [ Those thieves could have targeted my brother, or even my mother...]
    Petra: You’re right. Thanks to you, those scoundrels felt fear like never before.  
    Our little corner of Slepbone will be safer... at least for now.

- Petra: You are a true friend to our family. Please, rest at our camp whenever you need—consider this a small token of our gratitude.
    
